msgstr "Un traballo programado de Ekos fallou."

#: kstars/kstars.notifyrc:1695
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Imaging in scheduled Ekos job started"
msgstr "Comezou o escaneamento nun traballo programado de Ekos"

